<title>USA: US junk bond funds get $379.9 mln in new cash -AMG.</title>
<headline>US junk bond funds get $379.9 mln in new cash -AMG.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. high-yield bond mutual funds received  net cash inflows of $379.9 million in the latest recorded week, which  ended July 30, according to AMG Data Services.</p>
<p>Including this week's number, U.S. junk bond mutual funds have received  positive net cash inflows for each of the past nine consecutive weeks.</p>
</text>
